{"sessions": "4", "seconds": 240.0, "legs": {"call04_agent": {"name": "call04_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_6r2kdwmhswk0zy42", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.22, "commit_t": 6.4, "item_id": "item_thtkcgqsw6dxo6g4", "transcript": "您好，这里是 Orbix 客服热线，请问有什么可以帮您？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 284.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.7, "commit_t": 12.2, "item_id": "item_37792c8nwn3zxqse", "transcript": "请问您的手机号码是多少？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 201.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 21.8, "commit_t": 24.3, "item_id": "item_d8va3pldqj4t40lm", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 232.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 37.84, "commit_t": 41.8, "item_id": "item_tt00a2zamub5ztxr", "transcript": "补卡本身收取少量工本费，邮寄是免费的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 237.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 45.62, "commit_t": 49.8, "item_id": "item_d0nqi1krrce0rymz", "transcript": "好的，请您告诉我收货地址和联系电话。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 200.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 53.46, "commit_t": 60.5, "item_id": "item_98da9ey7ixlblnu4", "transcript": "新卡的初始 PIN 码在卡片的背面，您收到以后可以在手机设置里修改。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 301.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 64.14, "commit_t": 72.3, "item_id": "item_4abaaq6xdww0iq33", "transcript": "可以去任何一家营业厅，带上身份证就行。也可以在 App 里申请邮寄，三天内送到。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 320.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 75.12, "commit_t": 81.0, "item_id": "item_wvzif3c9w0cwacdq", "transcript": "已经停机了，请问您需要补办新的 SIM 卡，还是直接开通 eSIM？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 315.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 83.82, "commit_t": 90.6, "item_id": "item_5swwsv8zzlvwf3aw", "transcript": "您别着急，为了安全，我先帮您临时停机，这样别人就不能使用您的号码了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 336.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 101.6, "commit_t": 104.7, "item_id": "item_bqdgltrnqxyj5c87", "transcript": "好的，有任何问题随时联系我们。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 216.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 110.92, "commit_t": 118.7, "item_id": "item_8drc5kd5exakyq68", "transcript": "这种户型建议使用 Mesh 路由器组网，在卧室再放一个节点，信号就能覆盖全屋。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 363.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 121.36, "commit_t": 122.5, "item_id": "item_fo3hkgd863ls5hng", "transcript": "不复杂。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 170.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 122.6, "commit_t": 127.2, "item_id": "item_bcpfl9yho0ywtdr6", "transcript": "插上电，用 App 扫码，大约五分钟就可以完成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 247.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 127.38, "commit_t": 131.1, "item_id": "item_1aazrae7m6wh1f1i", "transcript": "如果您需要，我们也可以安排工程师上门安装。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 195.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 134.5, "commit_t": 141.9, "item_id": "item_ifve12d5zjsm9rl2", "transcript": "我们有三支装和四支装的套装，具体价格您可以在 App 的商城里面查看，现在有活动。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 319.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 144.08, "commit_t": 150.2, "item_id": "item_yzo329m7ygaw059g", "transcript": "购买套装包含一次免费上门安装，单独预约的话需要收取少量的服务费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 265.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 155.08, "commit_t": 161.3, "item_id": "item_8q5sndiahxa1xhl1", "transcript": "最好使用同一品牌的设备，这样可以统一管理，切换房间的时候也不会断网。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 295.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 172.64, "commit_t": 179.7, "item_id": "item_snby9z0k4s448ja4", "transcript": "系统显示是三个月前通过 App 开通的，当时有一个免费体验，到期以后自动续费了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 320.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 184.18, "commit_t": 186.3, "item_id": "item_qpif3de9hlbxqwuv", "transcript": "好的，我帮您查一下。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 188.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 186.36, "commit_t": 188.2, "item_id": "item_qurz6gxvswud262k", "transcript": "请问是哪一天扣的？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 199.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 191.2, "commit_t": 194.7, "item_id": "item_7231kl0o8gkwezht", "transcript": "不客气，请问还有什么可以帮您的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 223.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 196.4, "commit_t": 203.5, "item_id": "item_6q9stj8zafj00dcw", "transcript": "因为您没有使用过这个会员，我可以帮您申请退还这一个月的费用，同时关闭自动续费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 350.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 205.98, "commit_t": 212.0, "item_id": "item_n6g5axpoljv5a85x", "transcript": "已经关闭了，退款会在五个工作日内原路退回到您的话费账户。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 278.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 212.58, "commit_t": 215.4, "item_id": "item_x3x2t2orrzk0smk8", "transcript": "请问还有其他需要帮助的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 216.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 219.84, "commit_t": 223.1, "item_id": "item_l19kn6m58pz0aw8h", "transcript": "感谢您的来电，祝您生活愉快，再见。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 264.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call04_customer": {"name": "call04_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_jqetrl97w2obe96b", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 6.98, "commit_t": 8.8, "item_id": "item_wi0qq0a02odkntt4", "transcript": "喂，你好。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 141.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 12.9, "commit_t": 16.7, "item_id": "item_djko2k846yms4ll5", "transcript": "我的号码是一一三零。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 183.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 16.84, "commit_t": 21.3, "item_id": "item_bqkg70nd5vq60vvj", "transcript": "零七六六八零一。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 192.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 24.98, "commit_t": 27.3, "item_id": "item_yq0tox8xp9jgn62q", "transcript": "对，是我本人。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 221.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 27.6, "commit_t": 34.4, "item_id": "item_yw5j7rkilugg4oqk", "transcript": "喂，我彩普卡的 PIN 码输错了三次，现在被锁住了，怎么办？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 300.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 34.98, "commit_t": 37.0, "item_id": "item_fxzf1c7d1r2ni8ou", "transcript": "邮寄要收费吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 171.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 42.92, "commit_t": 44.9, "item_id": "item_lllbjf7lo73z6n4o", "transcript": "好的，那我选邮寄吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 207.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 50.48, "commit_t": 52.7, "item_id": "item_dm2amhd709btiwf5", "transcript": "新卡的 PIN 码是多少？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 182.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 61.12, "commit_t": 63.8, "item_id": "item_vehz2oznwqx9nbnj", "transcript": "不办实体卡要去营业厅吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 219.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 73.5, "commit_t": 76.0, "item_id": "item_zbefcg1pji1erl7y", "transcript": "好的，麻烦你帮我停一下。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 184.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 81.88, "commit_t": 84.5, "item_id": "item_j64hwbx0m18jdod8", "transcript": "手机是昨天晚上丢的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 237.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 91.06, "commit_t": 97.1, "item_id": "item_gh4oe4i0n62qkp8d", "transcript": "你好，我换了 Wi-Fi 7 以后，信号反而变差了，这是怎么回事？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 290.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 97.94, "commit_t": 100.2, "item_id": "item_hee9g1v2rce7jq1u", "transcript": "好，我先看看商城吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 182.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 105.9, "commit_t": 109.6, "item_id": "item_skhb17g3cd06cf17", "transcript": "我家是三室一厅，路由器放在客厅。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 216.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 119.38, "commit_t": 122.1, "item_id": "item_w55sxfgla26576g2", "transcript": "安装复杂吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 171.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 132.3, "commit_t": 135.2, "item_id": "item_qkrkza30fe2erv4q", "transcript": "Mesh 路，油漆要多少钱？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 188.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 142.72, "commit_t": 144.9, "item_id": "item_l9eti5w7yqugvche", "transcript": "上门安装收费吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 185.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 151.02, "commit_t": 152.5, "item_id": "item_oocymeqdcvv3c2xp", "transcript": "可以。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 190.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 153.44, "commit_t": 156.3, "item_id": "item_tndqb0tw26mt2krb", "transcript": "能和我现在的路由器一起用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 218.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 162.44, "commit_t": 166.7, "item_id": "item_q8uqmzhyjtelfbyb", "transcript": "你好，Orbix，这个月的扣费怎么回事？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 166.78, "commit_t": 168.9, "item_id": "item_hc7qq1igettc8epm", "transcript": "我想核对一下账单。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 189.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 169.82, "commit_t": 171.8, "item_id": "item_i0apik86b18l5ru9", "transcript": "我没有开通过啊。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 181.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 180.62, "commit_t": 183.7, "item_id": "item_kg0x7rc8s0uxj0t7", "transcript": "多出来的是一笔增值业务的费用。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 227.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 188.9, "commit_t": 190.7, "item_id": "item_esgb0szvq0ixoza5", "transcript": "明白了，谢谢。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 151.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 195.66, "commit_t": 197.2, "item_id": "item_sbk7rpt4oewj5ep4", "transcript": "那这个能退吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 167.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 204.58, "commit_t": 207.0, "item_id": "item_53hjd2ekcpua51as", "transcript": "好的，麻烦你帮我关掉。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 197.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 216.16, "commit_t": 219.2, "item_id": "item_4ybs9hj912dlnjbp", "transcript": "没有了，谢谢你。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 170.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 223.44, "commit_t": 225.0, "item_id": "item_dc5k5k4cdisixkac", "transcript": "好的，再见。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 202.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call07_agent": {"name": "call07_agent", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_no921cgqgg53xq2y", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 1.42, "commit_t": 6.3, "item_id": "item_1dv1esjibd34di7q", "transcript": "您好，Zentra，我是客服专员，请问您需要办理什么业务？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 271.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 9.96, "commit_t": 12.9, "item_id": "item_7jpc875mwxvvas8b", "transcript": "请问是机主本人在使用吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 197.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 17.16, "commit_t": 21.4, "item_id": "item_tx7m9j8tmkwr6gvu", "transcript": "为了保障您的账户安全，需要核实一下您的身份。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 243.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 21.44, "commit_t": 23.9, "item_id": "item_7lbnzk5cethkgfx6", "transcript": "请问，您的姓氏是？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 172.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 38.84, "commit_t": 44.6, "item_id": "item_0jx8jnjgzf9q03f6", "transcript": "可以的，您可以在 App 里选择号码转 eSIM，不需要去营业厅。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 282.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 51.24, "commit_t": 60.0, "item_id": "item_033dsbtffqw20sbq", "transcript": "在 App 的 EICM 界面点击生成二维码，有效期是半小时，过期需要重新生成。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 337.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 68.3, "commit_t": 70.7, "item_id": "item_n0d7ja1zd3ftinxo", "transcript": "这个型号是支持的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 178.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 70.96, "commit_t": 77.6, "item_id": "item_rr2oh4k5stou9zu8", "transcript": "我先帮您把二维码重新发送到您的邮箱，您可以直接在手机上打开。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 293.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 78.4, "commit_t": 80.4, "item_id": "item_5jcgfdc2ezs454yd", "transcript": "嗯嗯。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 153.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 85.02, "commit_t": 86.8, "item_id": "item_at2t38aqsamryvuk", "transcript": "好的，不着急。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 173.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 86.84, "commit_t": 93.1, "item_id": "item_jiqdslol7h01sg7o", "transcript": "如果升级以后还是不行，您把手机型号告诉我，我帮您核对是否支持。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 296.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 97.34, "commit_t": 105.5, "item_id": "item_qq9g3z1ez66olz3e", "transcript": "您需要准备身份证，并保证手机连着 WiFi，因为开通过程中会下载一个二维码配置。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 314.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 111.72, "commit_t": 116.0, "item_id": "item_pmi4em3pk95plv65", "transcript": "请您检查一下手机系统是不是最新版本。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 226.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 116.38, "commit_t": 121.1, "item_id": "item_qoit3jrn2irlx1gz", "transcript": "有的机型需要先做一次 OTA 升级才能识别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 237.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 126.52, "commit_t": 128.1, "item_id": "item_qwdetbq2j97vl7c8", "transcript": "太好了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 136.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 128.1, "commit_t": 131.6, "item_id": "item_tp5w64b4au1cnhfk", "transcript": "激活以后，实体卡会自动停用。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 255.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 131.6, "commit_t": 134.9, "item_id": "item_6607ib38gz99tldy", "transcript": "请您确认手机信号是不是正常。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 210.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 149.54, "commit_t": 154.9, "item_id": "item_v7xd33c7u4jmmrnl", "transcript": "您原来的合约不受影响，新套餐从下个月一号开始生效。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 290.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 154.9, "commit_t": 157.6, "item_id": "item_bi7olbxpxy5pl9ai", "transcript": "当月仍按原套餐计费。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 233.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 161.68, "commit_t": 164.0, "item_id": "item_jmy5jn80eqrowvr0", "transcript": "收到了，办理成功。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 217.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 164.02, "commit_t": 168.8, "item_id": "item_2lrhs4ythjq83zfw", "transcript": "新套餐下个月一号生效，您可以在 App 里查看详情。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 242.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 169.72, "commit_t": 172.5, "item_id": "item_djirhyju78j4b4tm", "transcript": "我给您介绍一下这几个套餐的区别。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 231.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 173.2, "commit_t": 177.6, "item_id": "item_rhgeflm7s03wc9e9", "transcript": "五 G 畅享 199，包含充足的国内流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 262.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 24, "speech_t": 177.8, "commit_t": 182.7, "item_id": "item_0bjlg1map5fa9k3p", "transcript": "通话时长足够日常使用，并且赠送一个视频会员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 263.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 25, "speech_t": 183.36, "commit_t": 187.9, "item_id": "item_mml8syb96imgn299", "transcript": "5G 尊享 299，则包含更多的流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 244.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 26, "speech_t": 187.9, "commit_t": 192.8, "item_id": "item_egdd0sukuxij2x8c", "transcript": "还可以和家人共享，最多可以添加三位家庭成员。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 191.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 27, "speech_t": 193.38, "commit_t": 199.8, "item_id": "item_tv2s058be4nsk0av", "transcript": "这些套餐都支持 e3m，您可以不用换卡，在手机里直接开通。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 279.4, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 28, "speech_t": 200.48, "commit_t": 207.8, "item_id": "item_jg3mzibw71engnv6", "transcript": "超出套餐流量以后，网速不会断，但是会降低。您也可以随时购买加油包。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 305.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 29, "speech_t": 208.34, "commit_t": 211.0, "item_id": "item_ra7n6avj7t2zuuub", "transcript": "套餐的变更需要您本人办理。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 236.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 30, "speech_t": 211.04, "commit_t": 214.2, "item_id": "item_2ukcrq48rbxgm6fg", "transcript": "办理成功后，会收到短信通知。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 215.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 31, "speech_t": 216.46, "commit_t": 221.6, "item_id": "item_325sqmum5262z56w", "transcript": "套餐名字里的数字就是月费，包含充足的通话和流量。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 246.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 32, "speech_t": 224.06, "commit_t": 228.8, "item_id": "item_2uihmw5pv9b0ta7k", "transcript": "网速是一样的，区别主要在流量和附加权益。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 235.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 33, "speech_t": 229.08, "commit_t": 233.4, "item_id": "item_abdhrmjzgjsu4zmx", "transcript": "尊享套餐可以免费使用 Orbix 的云盘空间。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 251.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}, "call07_customer": {"name": "call07_customer", "ended_by": "audio_done", "error": null, "session_id": "sess_sa6n6g5omi0pkwn1", "segments": [{"n": 1, "speech_t": 7.06, "commit_t": 8.9, "item_id": "item_4duicnr9ir865ud4", "transcript": "喂，你好。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 150.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 2, "speech_t": 14.24, "commit_t": 16.6, "item_id": "item_gj6xtn7uwvklsild", "transcript": "对，是我本人。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 227.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 3, "speech_t": 24.38, "commit_t": 27.8, "item_id": "item_dwvr6axx94h35e71", "transcript": "我姓王，哈哈哈哈哈。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 212.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 4, "speech_t": 28.62, "commit_t": 32.6, "item_id": "item_4srxo85o9iwiqsoq", "transcript": "喂，我想把现在的号码转到 eSIM 上，可以吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 260.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 5, "speech_t": 33.46, "commit_t": 37.0, "item_id": "item_l20qo7xf7m2yfij2", "transcript": "我现在用的是实体 SIM 吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 232.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 6, "speech_t": 37.24, "commit_t": 38.2, "item_id": "item_g9gyjrxqc6u9bb15", "transcript": "卡。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 161.9, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 7, "speech_t": 45.96, "commit_t": 48.1, "item_id": "item_x2r0ie1r32ywe41u", "transcript": "自由的。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 145.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 8, "speech_t": 48.72, "commit_t": 50.5, "item_id": "item_blsc0nlneoeypsn1", "transcript": "二维码在哪里看？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 150.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 9, "speech_t": 60.62, "commit_t": 61.6, "item_id": "item_cg0ro0lzby6dn6mw", "transcript": "停。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 168.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 10, "speech_t": 62.22, "commit_t": 67.2, "item_id": "item_d5etmjt6ynr96tl3", "transcript": "手机型号是五G畅享一百九十九配套的那款。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 11, "speech_t": 80.8, "commit_t": 83.6, "item_id": "item_nhkijauulra5gund", "transcript": "我现在去升级，等一下再打给你们。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 204.7, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 12, "speech_t": 93.68, "commit_t": 94.6, "item_id": "item_d7wsjn2cjgr3vsjf", "transcript": "行。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 242.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 13, "speech_t": 95.38, "commit_t": 98.0, "item_id": "item_oijfyydh7vd01gta", "transcript": "需要准备什么吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 212.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 14, "speech_t": 106.44, "commit_t": 110.6, "item_id": "item_9whcc6qvzapdg982", "transcript": "我扫了，但是手机提示无法添加。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 232.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 15, "speech_t": 121.64, "commit_t": 123.1, "item_id": "item_s45amjb18wsctmif", "transcript": "哦，明白了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 153.1, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 16, "speech_t": 124.28, "commit_t": 127.4, "item_id": "item_ipfgs4et98og7p62", "transcript": "收到了，好像可以啦。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 178.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 17, "speech_t": 136.16, "commit_t": 137.1, "item_id": "item_yvuyp58vsjvh9r2l", "transcript": "请。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 176.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 18, "speech_t": 137.9, "commit_t": 144.8, "item_id": "item_sr30h9pfesb7wbzm", "transcript": "喂，我现在用的是五G畅享一百九十九，感觉流量不太够用，能换个大一点的吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 332.2, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 19, "speech_t": 145.76, "commit_t": 149.0, "item_id": "item_d6odqkbrh517elo2", "transcript": "换了套餐以后，原来的合约怎么办？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 214.8, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 20, "speech_t": 158.2, "commit_t": 162.6, "item_id": "item_rh5gwqa0vma9uqw7", "transcript": "短信收到了，我回复了。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 215.3, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 21, "speech_t": 215.16, "commit_t": 217.2, "item_id": "item_9kyslxqq0kx1w0e8", "transcript": "那个套餐每个月多少钱？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 202.5, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 22, "speech_t": 222.9, "commit_t": 225.1, "item_id": "item_vypbaqplo5hbp6nt", "transcript": "这些套餐的网速有区别吗？", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 241.6, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}, {"n": 23, "speech_t": 234.08, "commit_t": 237.7, "item_id": "item_31kdqzpcg0mt0z4n", "transcript": "好，那就换成五G畅享 199 吧。", "language": "zh", "latency_ms": 261.0, "deltas": 0, "failed": null}]}}, "bot_rows": "spikes/results/transcription_latency_4.bots.jsonl"}